    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 45 Ballintyre Square, Ballinteer, Dublin 16 to the market a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom penthouse apartment ideally positioned within the ever-popular Ballintyre development. Renowned for its beautifully maintained grounds and exceptional convenience, Ballintyre is one of South Dublin's most sought-after residential developments. A wealth of amenities are within easy reach including Dundrum Town Centre, Ballinteer Shopping Centre and Marley Park, along with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets and leisure facilities. The area is also home to a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, while excellent public transport links and easy access to the M50 provide seamless connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\n\nBright and generously proportioned internal living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, spacious open plan lounge and dining area, fully fitted kitchen, three well-proportioned bedrooms including a master ensuite, and a main family bathroom. Occupying a penthouse position, the property enjoys an abundance of natural light throughout along with a spacious and well-balanced layout perfectly suited to modern living.\n\nNo. 45 offers an exceptional opportunity to acquire a spacious penthouse apartment in one of Dublin 16's most desirable developments. Combining generous accommodation, a premium setting and a superb range of amenities on its doorstep, this property is sure to appeal to first time buyers, those looking to trade down and investors alike. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 120 sqm\n• BER B\n• 3 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Penthouse apartment\n• Management fee's c. 3,500 per annum \n• Two designated parking spaces\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Turn key condition\n• Top quality finishes and fittings\n• Sunny balcony\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n• Viewing highly advised\n\nMeasurements;\nLiving Room: 4.27m X 5.96m.\nKitchen: 2.96m X 4.37m.\nDining Area: 2.96m X 2.44m.\nBedroom 1: 4.22m X 7.31m.\nBedroom 2: 3.03m X 6.81m.\nBedroom 3: 3.40m X 4.26m.\nBathroom: 2.12m X 2.19m.\nEn-suite: 1.72m X 2.19m.\nHallway: 11.49m X 2.18m.\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D16CR55"
      },
